        "description": "__Height:__ 167 cm\n\nA coolheaded dreamer from the countryside.\n\nOriginally hailing from the countryside, she enrolled in Tracen Academy after dominating the racing scene back home. She works to make her hometown proud, but try as she might, her clumsy side always comes out. At the academy, she's known as a fearsome gourmand, able to empty an entire pot of rice in the blink of an eye.",
