        "description": "__Height:__ 164 cm\n\nKeeping it old-school! A real hot rod!\n\nA dashing Umamusume with a sisterly demeanor and a retro way of speaking. She is a speed demon who adores the pure joy of the wind in her face. On the road, her hot rod is the one burning rubber, but in a race, it's her own two feet tearing up the track. Despite her tremendous power, she isn't pompous, and is well-liked by everyone.\n\nIn Uma Musume: Pretty Derby she is member of Team Rigil.",
