        "description": "**Height:** 156cm\n\nFollow your dreams! This Umamusume is honest and hardworking.\n\nA pure-hearted, honest Umamusume. She admires [Maruzensky](https://anilist.co/character/140842/Maruzensky), and aims to be her equal in every way. She makes a habit out of filling her \"Chiyonotes\" with proverbs relevant to her daily experiences—though few but her are able to parse them.",
