        "description": "__Height:__ 158 cm\n\nA blunt racer and the gold standard in racing and beauty.\n\nA beauty the likes of which will only appear once every one hundred years. She's been a model for as long as she can remember, and has always acted the part. She realized one day, however, that running is her true heart's desire. Since then, she has raced ever forward so that she may be recognized not for her looks, but for her talent. She's understood most by her good friend Tosen Jordan.",
