        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 167 cm\n\nShe's gonna be the biggest star in the world! A charismatic Umamusume of great ambitions.\n\n\"The brightest star out there is Sirius.\" With unmatched confidence and the prowess to back it up, she dreams of winning big on the world stage. Her rough mannerisms and crude way of speaking exude a toughness and charisma that attracts many to her. She despises lies and ambiguity, so everyone knows that she means exactly what she says. In other words, she's a natural-born star in every sense.",
