        "description": "__Height:__ 166 cm\n\nBound by nothing! A cheerful and flawless Umamusume.\n\nA Umamusume who loves the free world of racing. The unbounded ambiance she exudes gives her a mysterious charm. At first glance, she appears to be free-spirited, but it's because she's stubborn and refuses to do anything she doesn't agree with. Surprisingly, she may be a bit clumsier than most other Umamusume.",
