        "description": "**Height:** 159cm\n\nShe runs with the dignity of a warrior. This Umamusume is rough and rugged.\n\nWith fists that pierce the wind and kicks that shake the earth, this martial artist trains not to harm others but to succeed on the track. Though she strives to maintain discipline and decorum, her hotheaded side sometimes seeps to the surface. She loves her grandparents very much, and seeks to do them proud by spreading their school of martial arts far and wide.",
