        "description": "**Height:** 162 cm\n\nShe wants to shine bright, no matter how briefly! This well-to-do girl has legs of glass.\n\nA sheltered young lady—ephemeral, gentle, and thoughtful. Despite her fragile, \"glass\" legs putting her at a disadvantage when running, she refuses to let cynicism keep her down. As a child, her frail body kept her from most recreation and social activities, so she finds community life at the academy to be quite the novel experience.",
